1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,760
kW at kWh… pareho
lang ba 'yan?

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,880
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:12,320
Ang kW ay power: gaano
kabilis gumamit ng kuryente.

4
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:17,640
Ang kWh ay energy: gaano
karami ang nagamit.

5
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:21,670
Halimbawa, isang
100-watt na TV.

6
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:23,690
Kapag binuksan
mo nang 10 oras,

7
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,930
1 kWh ang nagamit nito.

8
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:31,530
Sa Meralco bill, kWh ang
basehan ng energy charges.

9
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:37,960
Kaya bago mag-solar,
kilalanin pareho: kW at kWh.

10
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:43,840
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

11
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,600
Life is SoLight with Solar.
